            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Advocacy for Science and Technology in Agriculture</strong><br>\nHe was an advocate for the use of science and technology in agriculture, including plant breeding and environmentally sustainable practices to increase crop productivity.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Legacy and Honors</strong><br>\nBorlaug's work earned him the title \"Father of the Green Revolution,\" and he was honored with numerous awards and recognitions. His approaches to agricultural development continue to influence farming and food production practices.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Death and Enduring Influence</strong><br>\nBorlaug passed away on September 12, 2009. His legacy is reflected in the ongoing efforts to combat hunger and achieve food security through sustainable agricultural practices.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
